ings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2023 Q4","e":"rng","d":"2024-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vlad Shmunis","x":"And this is just as businesses are rightsizing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/20/ringcentral-rng-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2024 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2024-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vlad Shmunis","x":"With RingCentral, companies have the ability to streamline workflows with our advanced tools and integration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2024 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2024-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sonalee Parekh","x":"This more closely reflects the cash flow generation of our business in a given period and includes cash paid for interest and other nonrecurring items, such as restructuring, which we will call out separately.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2024 Q2","e":"rng","d":"2024-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vladimir G. Shmunis","x":"And for customers looking to streamline workflows while leveraging the power of AI, we have the RingEX, RingEX combination to offer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/02/ringcentral-rng-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2024 Q2","e":"rng","d":"2024-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sonalee Parekh","x":"This includes interest of $8 million, restructuring and other payments of $3 million, and cash received from strategic partners of $10 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/02/ringcentral-rng-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2024 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2024-11-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vladimir G. Shmunis","x":"Abhey joins us from Amazon Web Services where he is vice president of finance for global infrastructure, including Gen AI investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/08/ringcentral-rng-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2024 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2024-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vaibhav Agarwal","x":"Our outlook includes capitalized expenditures of $85 million, cash paid for interest of $60 million, restructuring and other payments of $27 million as well as $25 million of cash received from certain strategic partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/08/ringcentral-rng-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2024 Q4","e":"rng","d":"2025-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vladimir G. Shmunis","x":"Importantly, RingCX will be replacing several cloud contact center solutions as Genpact looks to continuously improve and streamline its platforms.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/20/ringcentral-rng-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2025 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2025-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Shmunis","x":"We are innovating rapidly with the majority of our quarter-billion-dollar annual spend on innovation now being dedicated to our new AI-led product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/ringcentral-rng-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2025 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2025-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Shmunis","x":"And if people are using the product less, then no amount of financial engineering or price increases or anything.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/ringcentral-rng-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2025 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2025-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vaibhav Agarwal","x":"It's effort and a disciplined approach that we are taking in rightsizing the cost base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/ringcentral-rng-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Kira Makagon","x":"A major Internet and streaming provider added RingEX to their existing RingCX deployment, along with AI capabilities, including ACE to drive greater operational efficiency. [ Casio ], an iconic consumer electronics company, consolidated their legacy systems onto RingEX and RingCX and added ACE…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Shmunis","x":"Customers using our AI adopt more products, spend more with us and stay longer, driving higher ARPU and net retention well above 100%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Shmunis","x":"And we -- RingCentral, we are actually in a very interesting position to where we are both very heavy users of AI internally, and spending quite a bit of attention and effort on that, but as well as, of course, providing frontline, customer-facing AI tools.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Shmunis","x":"And if nothing else, it gives us pricing power and flexibility because we also don't have any third parties to pay to.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Shmunis","x":"So single platform, single invoice, single SLA, single bill, all kinds of efficiencies and cost savings across the board.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vaibhav Agarwal","x":"I mean we ended the quarter with record operating margin, and we are raising our guide for the full year, further expanding margins now by 100 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q1","e":"rng","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Vaibhav Agarwal","x":"And Q1 was another proof point, strong free cash flow, free cash flow per share, raising the guide for the full year, all while again, investing in innovation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/ringcentral-rng-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vladimir G. Shmunis","x":"Second, our investments in agentic Voice AI strategy are delivering tangible results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/ringcentral-rng-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2026-10-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vaibhav Agarwal","x":"Our margin expansion trend is driven by multiple drivers, such as strong gross margins, operating leverage, disciplined cost management, broader internal adoption of AI, and a focus on our highest return investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/ringcentral-rng-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RNG 2026 Q3","e":"rng","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vaibhav Agarwal","x":"And customers are willing to pay because they are getting tangible ROI benefits both from a revenue standpoint as well as a cost avoidance or cost savings standpoint And that is the uplift as indicated in the metric that I just talked about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/ringcentral-rng-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"tr